From 87140a1c3752508e41f9bf8f4f474707fb83b674 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bhakthavatsala Raghavendra <bhaktha@google.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jul 2024 16:58:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Set LE Data length on LE CoC connection

- Set Max length as Data length for LE CoC sockets
- Allow privileged clients to decrease the data length in order
  to provide bandwidth for other ACLs (eg: ASHA)
- Prioritize the privileged client's data length over other requests

Test: mmm packages/modules/Bluetooth
Flag: com.android.bluetooth.flags.set_max_data_length_for_lecoc
Bug: 206487778
Bug: 373726267

Change-Id: Ia4a05b2c74dd7c025fc8e52ee9739dbcfabe340d
---
